            "name": "GOD STARFIGHTER",
            "steam_appid": 708970,
            "required_age": "14",
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "GOD STARFIGHTER is a unique and innovative fusion of roguelite and puzzle game.  Despite being based on a classic arcade experience, it is the quick wits, calculated management and craftiness that will lead you to victory here. Each wave of foes will issue a different challenge to you and you'll have to shape a mighty answer to them from the list of your intricate, mystic and ever-morphing equipment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 30+ hours of intense roguelite combat - high replayability!<br />\r\n- Lots of thinking and scheming required!<br />\r\n- Innovative gameplay that is like nothing else you've experienced.<br />\r\n- Big tutorial and adjustable difficulty: from challenging to extremely challenging.<br />\r\n- Hardcore - prepare to mostly die through the initial hours of the game.<br />\r\n- 50+ highly differing Equipment pieces<br />\r\n- 5 starship hulls to choose from.<br />\r\n- Distinct enemies based on Tarot major arcanas - 22 foes assemble in over a hundred of compositions!<br />\r\n- Various Game Modes: roguelite campaign, endless battle, warp nine.<br />\r\n- Comedic mini-events with deep choices.",
            "about_the_game": "GOD STARFIGHTER is a unique and innovative fusion of roguelite and puzzle game.  Despite being based on a classic arcade experience, it is the quick wits, calculated management and craftiness that will lead you to victory here. Each wave of foes will issue a different challenge to you and you'll have to shape a mighty answer to them from the list of your intricate, mystic and ever-morphing equipment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 30+ hours of intense roguelite combat - high replayability!<br />\r\n- Lots of thinking and scheming required!<br />\r\n- Innovative gameplay that is like nothing else you've experienced.<br />\r\n- Big tutorial and adjustable difficulty: from challenging to extremely challenging.<br />\r\n- Hardcore - prepare to mostly die through the initial hours of the game.<br />\r\n- 50+ highly differing Equipment pieces<br />\r\n- 5 starship hulls to choose from.<br />\r\n- Distinct enemies based on Tarot major arcanas - 22 foes assemble in over a hundred of compositions!<br />\r\n- Various Game Modes: roguelite campaign, endless battle, warp nine.<br />\r\n- Comedic mini-events with deep choices.",
            "short_description": "GOD STARFIGHTER is a fusion of a roguelite and puzzle game. We're the dark soul of space invaders genre. Extremely challenging combat that is logic-based, innovative guns, equipment and enemies, tough choices and light humour - we have it all.",
